OL,3,GNEWSAOnline trend driving break-ins,
OL,4,Aestate owner says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a Georgian country house
OL,7,Fbelieves "online trends" have driven
OL,8,Fbreak-ins at his properties.
OL,10,FWilliam Reeve, who owns Leadenham
OL,11,FHouse, Lincolnshire, said a video
OL,12,Fposted on social media showing an
OL,13,F"urban explorer" inside one of his
OL,14,Fcottages, sparked "copycat" incidents,
OL,15,Fincluding intruders entering his home
OL,16,Fwhile he slept.
OL,18,FDr Kevin Bingham, an expert on urban
OL,19,Fexploring, said social media was
OL,20,Fleading some people to take it up "for
OL,21,Fthe wrong reasons now and not for
OL,22,Fgenuine interest in historical sites".
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
